---
title: How to Print a Quotation
sidebar:
  order: 6
---
**To print a quotation:**

1. **Go to the “Quotation” section:**

   - **On the left sidebar, click on “Quotations” to view the list of Quotation.**

1. **Select the Quotation to print:**

   - **Find the Quotation you wish to print from the list.**
   - **Click the ellipsis menu (…) next to the Quotation.**
